    "凭据仅在当前页面显示一次。关闭页面、切换后台或授权变化后会清除；普通查询和原请求恢复不能取回。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据仅在当前页面显示一次。关闭页面、切换后台或授权变化后会清除；普通查询和原请求恢复不能取回。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These credentials are shown only once on this screen. They are cleared when the screen closes, the app leaves the foreground, or authorization changes. Normal queries and original-request recovery cannot retrieve them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
